{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Chengyue-Lu/research-agent-workbench/pulls/80","id":4536255099,"node_id":"PR_kwDOT2gtDc8AAAABDmHCew","html_url":"https://github.com/Chengyue-Lu/research-agent-workbench/pull/80","diff_url":"https://github.com/Chengyue-Lu/research-agent-workbench/pull/80.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Chengyue-Lu/research-agent-workbench/pull/80.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Chengyue-Lu/research-agent-workbench/issues/80","number":80,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat(M14-005): verify protected develop source CI provenance","user":{"login":"Chengyue-Lu","id":140945476,"node_id":"U_kgDOCGaoRA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140945476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chengyue-Lu","html_url":"https://github.com/Chengyue-Lu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chengyue-Lu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chengyue-Lu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chengyue-Lu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chengyue-Lu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chengyue-Lu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chengyue-Lu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chengyue-Lu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chengyue-Lu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chengyue-Lu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## 治理元数据\n\n- **PR 类型**: feature\n- **任务 ID**: M14-005\n- **风险等级**: R2\n- **责任人**: @Chengyue-Lu\n- **工作流目录**: docs/workstreams/chengyue-lu/M14-CURATED-RELEASE\n\n## 范围与非目标\n\ndevelop push 在同一个 CI run 中重验实际 squash parent→source 的治理；在线 observer 认证 repository、workflow、run、attempt、job、check App 和成功状态。维护者明确作出 v0.1.0 首发范围与准备决定，fresh remote protection 回读通过，当前候选将 M14-005 激活为 READY。\n\n## 契约与权威影响\n\n- **共享契约**: yes\n- **权威、权限或数据边界**: yes\n\nsource governance 只在 develop push 使用 governance 名称，PR 事件的 inactive job 不与独立 PR governance 门禁共名。生产端绑定唯一 exact merged PR、实际 squash delta 与 reviewed/integrated tree；消费端在线绑定同源完整 CI 的最新 attempt、GitHub Actions App 15368 和 check suite，遇到缺失、重复、失败、skipped、分页不全或 rerun 竞态时 fail closed。\n\n`source-governance.json` 是单独的审计附件。`attest` 不下载、hash 或校验它；信任来自在线 run/job/check 核验。未来 protected caller 必须自己调用在线 observer，不能凭保存的 JSON 或候选 manifest 授信。\n\n## TASKS 状态变更\n\nM14-005: BLOCKED → READY。只改状态，Task 定义、依赖、owner、风险和验收不变；其他 canonical Task 行不变。\n\n## 权威依据\n\n路诚钺于 2026-09-15 对当前任务中的具体决定回复：“确认上述 v0.1.0 范围与准备授权”。首发范围为届时冻结 develop 的完整源码、已发布 Schema、必需公开 Runtime Registry、MIT、构建元数据、公开文档和离线 no-Skill Quickstart，接受 structural/bounded 成熟度、生产 Skill Projection 为空、无 live Provider 保证且无 M5 净收益实证。此决定授权 READY 与实现/cutover 准备，最终 release PR 合并及 tag 另行批准。\n\n2026-09-15 14:41:58 UTC fresh readback 核验 main/develop 的四层 active rulesets、branch protection 和 effective rules 一致；hard 无 bypass，required checks 绑定 App 15368/strict latest base，review 仅保留既有 Chengyue-Lu PR-only 例外。五个 canonical M 依赖在基线均 DONE。详见 `docs/workstreams/chengyue-lu/M14-CURATED-RELEASE/FIRST_RELEASE_DECISION.md`。此决定不批准本 PR 自行合并，也不构成单次审核例外。\n\n## 验证证据\n\n2026-09-16 最终 rebase 基线：b041aeef8c32b74bc4399f90bf3fb49fbbb4fc22（含 PR #82 Gate B closeout、PR #83 CI selection 修复及本轮期间合入的 PR #75 M6 baseline 实现）。原候选 f1ee42f34b69ee1ec346e818b2170935e7c6d162 的 source-CI 代码、测试、workflow 和既有冻结 Attempt 保持字节一致；状态文档保留上游 Gate B SATISFIED 与 M14 READY 提案。\n\nM14-005 implementation slice: fcca8a6；具名准备决定与 receipt 修正 slice: f62d48b；第一轮 develop@75fbf97 的 111 项回归（含 CI planner）通过，随后发现 develop 前移；最终基线重新校验 source-CI/docs/public surface/coverage policy，并对 M6 与 M14 coverage entries 做精确合并检查。最终候选 head：47f518a164c59bb123541bc8c0705f2106ee513e。新基线 focused 59 PASS，repository 186/0/0；治理、scope、合并后的 coverage policy 与 CI plan 验证 PASS；最终文档 10 PASS，Trace 无 BLOCK，保留 capture-gap warning。首轮托管 CI 35086048928：Python 3.13 全部 1346 PASS；3.11 覆盖率作业在两个 witness 测试的临时仓库清理时失败（Directory not empty），共运行 1346 项、2 个清理错误。81d46bf 将临时 fixture 的 maintenance.auto=false、gc.auto=0 限定为仓库局部配置；前后 Git trace 中 detached maintenance 启动由 3 次降为 0，原失败案例 2 PASS、完整 witness 10 PASS。生产 witness 逻辑不变，保留严格清理。修复后的 [exact-head CI 35087884396](https://github.com/Chengyue-Lu/research-agent-workbench/actions/runs/35087884396) 全部通过：Python 3.11.16 / 3.13.15 各 1346/1346 PASS；coverage-quality 1320/1320 PASS、单次 coverage-execution 1346/1346 PASS；global line 94.95%；governance checker line 98.21% / branch 97.95%；source-CI line/branch 100% / 100%。双 Python package smoke、repository、documentation 及两个 required test aggregates 均 PASS。历史 head f1ee42f 的 CI 34984632827 双 Python 各 1289 PASS，仅作旧候选证据。\n\n## Review 修复\n\n- P1：通过具名 v0.1.0 准备决定和 fresh protection 回读闭合外部启动条件，同步 canonical READY 与派生导航。历史 BLOCKED 提交和 frozen Attempt 保持原样，不追溯改写授权时间。\n- P2：明确 producer receipt 的审计作用及 `attest` 的在线信任边界；没有改变 source-CI 机制。\n- 原 head f1ee42f 的 [owner 技术复核](https://github.com/Chengyue-Lu/research-agent-workbench/pull/80#issuecomment-5682851647) 已确认 P1/P2 关闭且无新的 P0/P1；本次 rebase 后仍需当前候选的 R2 审批。\n\n## 对抗性证据\n\n真实 Git fixture 校验实际 squash-delta 治理，拒绝错误 PR/parent/tree/metadata；API matrix 拒绝跨仓、错 workflow/SHA、PR/dispatch run、旧 attempt、伪 check/App、分页缺口与 rerun。旧绿色 develop CI 34939526577 因缺少 governance 被拒绝的历史负例保留。\n\n## 剩余风险与后续\n\nPR CI 不能证明本 PR 合入后的真实 protected develop push。R2 接受并合入后，先在 exact source checkout 验收在线 `attest`，另行下载 producer receipt 供审计，再推进 release-only checks/policy include 与 atomic cutover 准备。实际 cutover、source/parent freeze、projection/prospective-tree equality、双 Python 安装、公开表面、最终 release PR 和 tag/artifact/hash 仍需各自门禁与验收。\n\nRuntime、Schema、Registry、Skill admission、release policy 与当前 dormant topology 保持原样；本次没有创建 release ref/tag、修改远端保护或操作 primary develop。Refs #57。\n\n## 留痕\n\n原实现档案：`work/M14-005/A-20260915-003/INDEX.yaml`，保持冻结。本轮修复档案：`work/M14-005/A-20260915-004/INDEX.yaml`，保存 review、具名决定转录、fresh protection 回读、rebase 和验证证据；最终 head 托管 CI 以本 PR 回执为准。\n\n## 本轮 rebase 与下一步\n\n维护者指令：“rebase到最新develop，并确认下一步计划。”原具名 v0.1.0 准备授权继续适用；本轮不扩大实现范围。\n\n1. 完成本次 rebase 的 exact-head CI；取得当前候选跨 owner R2 审批，或按 DEVELOPMENT 5.4 另行记录 exact-base/head 单次例外及合并授权。\n2. PR #80 接受并获准合并后，验证该 squash source 的真实 protected develop push：source_governance 成功，并在 exact source checkout 运行 live attest；producer JSON 另作审计附件。\n3. 该 source-CI 链验收后，下一实现 slice 才推进 release-only workflow/checks、exact policy include 与 atomic cutover 准备。\n4. 全部门禁满足后冻结 source/parent，形成可重复 projection，验证 prospective-tree equality、安装、公开链接与零内部材料泄漏；最终 release PR/tag 另行批准。\n\n本轮档案：work/M14-005/A-20260916-001/INDEX.yaml。旧冻结档案不重写；此 PR 不自行合并。\n\nCI fixture 修复档案：`work/M14-005/A-20260916-002/INDEX.yaml`；保存失败清理片段、前后 trace 摘要和本地回归。未在本地复现原清理错误；修复后的托管 CI 已验证所有测试通过。\n\n最终工件核对：base `b041aeef8c32b74bc4399f90bf3fb49fbbb4fc22`，head `47f518a164c59bb123541bc8c0705f2106ee513e`，测试 target `9be53370987d4683779555d65c0fdd31b7dc3262`；plan digest `fbd0bb35560ddd7561b086a35dee606d9d5c969db6f9f5cdd1e643171f6f138a` 重算匹配，full/impact+repository/package 规则生效，各测试回执均绑定此 plan/target。此处 PR 事件下 source-governance inactive 按设计 skipped；真实 protected develop push 仍待授权合入后验收。\n","created_at":"2026-09-15T11:04:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-18T04:00:12Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Chengyue-Lu/research-agent-workbench/pulls/80/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Chengyue-Lu/research-agent-workbench/pulls/80/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Chengyue-Lu/research-agent-workbench/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Chengyue-Lu/research-agent-workbench/issues/80/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Chengyue-Lu/research-agent-workbench/statuses/47f518a164c59bb123541bc8c0705f2106ee513e","head":{"label":"Chengyue-Lu:feature/m14-005-source-ci","ref":"feature/m14-005-source-ci","sha":"47f518a164c59bb123541bc8c0705f2106ee513e","user":{"login":"Chengyue-Lu","id